[agent] ## Result: the leaking feature is **f5**
[agent] All analysis ran on the Databricks platform — I uploaded the CSV to a Unity Catalog volume (`workspace.mlpab044ac1.leakdata`), loaded it into the table `workspace.mlpab044ac1.training_data`, and ran every computation through the SQL warehouse.
